                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Tri-Motors Safety Airways/15:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Judah</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-05-06T16:00:00-05:00">May 6, 1929—4 p.m.</date><lb/>[Received
                        5:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>31. Referring to the Department’s 39, April 30, 2 p.m. Permission granted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Judah</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
